# Berserk gives "+X/+0 until end of turn, where X is its power". Arni, Renowned Champion (1/5) is -3/4 after Ray of
# Enfeeblement's -4/-1, so X would be -3: a calculation that yields a negative number uses zero instead (CR 107.1b), and
# Arni stays -3/4 rather than becoming -6/4. Every spell is paid on turn 1 from Black Lotus and the Moxen, so Ray's
# -4/-1 still applies.

